{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.DeriveFintype","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Card"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.b1_hyperbolic_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.b1_hyperbolic_rows","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L91-L101","doc":"**B1 holds at at least 3 hyperbolic rows** — *derived* from the per-row\nconjecture, not assumed. Conditional on the two external inputs, the set\nof rows carrying B1 is all of them, hence has cardinality `3`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:b1-hyperbolic-rows-theorem","label":"conj:b1-hyperbolic-rows-theorem","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/b1-hyperbolic-rows-theorem.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.card_hyperbolicRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.card_hyperbolicRow","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L87-L88","doc":"There are exactly three hyperbolic rows on record. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.b1_holds_at_row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.b1_holds_at_row","kind":"axiom","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L75-L85","doc":"**Conjecture (`conj:b1-hyperbolic-rows-theorem`), per-row form.**\nConditional on the Bloch–Suslin regulator condition and van der Veen's\nVolume-Conjecture extensions, B1 holds at each of the three rows.\n\nThis is where the conjectural content lives. It is falsifiable: it says\nsomething about the named `B1HoldsAt` at each named row, rather than\nabout an arbitrary numeral. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.B1HoldsAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.B1HoldsAt","kind":"opaque","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L71-L73","doc":"**B1 holds at a given hyperbolic row.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.VanDerVeenVolumeConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.VanDerVeenVolumeConjecture","kind":"opaque","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L66-L69","doc":"**van der Veen et al.'s Volume-Conjecture extensions** — an external open\ninput. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.BlochSuslinRegulator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.BlochSuslinRegulator","kind":"opaque","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L62-L64","doc":"**Bloch–Suslin regulator condition** — an external open input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.instFintypeHyperbolicRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.instFintypeHyperbolicRow","kind":"instance","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.instDecidableEqHyperbolicRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.instDecidableEqHyperbolicRow","kind":"instance","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.twistKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.twistKnot","kind":"ctor","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.whitehead","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.whitehead","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.borromean","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow.borromean","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AppendixSurreals.B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.HyperbolicRow","kind":"inductive","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AppendixSurreals/B1HyperbolicRowsTheorem.lean#L54-L60","doc":"The three hyperbolic rows at which the B1 keystone is claimed:\nthe Borromean rings, the Whitehead link, and the twist-knot family. ","signatureChunk":0}]}